WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.606 --> 00:00:10.508
PRÓ150F: 8 students, one
tutorial group so far (Dæmatími 1 *).

2
00:00:10.608 --> 00:00:16.509
Double-click for a second group;
Tegund (type): Dæmatími.

3
00:00:16.609 --> 00:00:22.510
Heiti: Dæmatími 2, and tick
Samhliða – one of the groups.

4
00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:28.511
Save: Spói divides the students
between the groups by itself.

5
00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:34.512
Nemendafjöldi blank: the course
is shared – 8 / 2 = 4 in each.

6
00:00:34.612 --> 00:00:40.513
A number takes its share first;
the blank groups share the rest.

7
00:00:40.613 --> 00:00:46.515
Sýna nemendur (show students):
the 4 placed in this group.

8
00:00:46.615 --> 00:00:52.516
Tillaga (suggestion): placed by
Spói, not in TermTime yet.

9
00:00:52.616 --> 00:00:59.246
Bóka: a group is booked as
Man allocate, with its students.

10
00:00:59.346 --> 00:01:05.068
Its 4 students are now
on the group in TermTime.

11
00:01:05.168 --> 00:01:12.660
Bóka allt: the other group,
also with its own students.

12
00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:18.662
Each booking sends the whole list,
replacing whoever was there.
